          "worked": "Let $s$ be the missing triangular side, in metres.\n$$\\begin{align*} s^2 &= 4^2+2^2\\\\ s^2 &= 20\\\\ s &= 2\\sqrt5.\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*} A &= 2\\left(\\frac12\\times4\\times2\\right)+3(4+2+2\\sqrt5)\\\\ A &= 8+18+6\\sqrt5\\\\ A &= (26+6\\sqrt5)\\,\\mathrm{m}^2.\\end{align*}$$",
